DeepSeek Harness page (www.deepseek.com/harness), so the poster renders
offline and inside the Harness Web UI.

  DM Sans — weights 400, 500, 700
    assets/dm-sans-400.woff2, assets/dm-sans-500.woff2, assets/dm-sans-700.woff2
