Shader backdrop
---------------
The WebGL2 fragment and vertex shaders in client.js are adapted from the
DeepSeek Harness page backdrop (www.deepseek.com/harness). The five colour
constants of that page, and its scale, offset, grain, bloom, vignette and
light values, were changed into uniforms so the studio can repaint and
retune the backdrop; the rest of the shader is unchanged.

Runtime data
------------
The current poster design is written to
  <DSH_HOME>/poster-studio/spec.json
and rendered images are written to
  <DSH_HOME>/poster-studio/exports/
Both live under the DSH home directory and hold nothing but poster data.
